{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/MiddleTitle_Eng_Story.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure with 'KIND'</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'KIND' are beings who can speak human words and have similar intelligence to humans. They were described as gods in the far distant past and then as monsters and ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some 'KIND' have much stronger power than humans, while others 'KIND' run on water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These mysterious beings are not easily seen in cities, but they seem to be quite common in the countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/1.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You come to visit your rural grandmother's house for the anniversary of the opening of elementary school, and you get lost in the forest where there is a magic well, and you meet with 'KIND' Barabin, an explorer who resembles kidney beans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/VERTICAL_GAME_INTRO_IMAGE_ENG_\ud0c0\uc774\ud2c0\uc218\uc815.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The explorer Barabin, who never leaves a troubled man alone,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With him, the journey begins to return to his grandmother's house!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/MiddleTitle_Eng_Feature.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/SmallTitle_Eng_Adventure.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/\uc608\uce21\ubd88\ud5c8_1.gif?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your adventure is full of unknowable weather events and strange events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What other events will unfold in front of you after crossing a lake frozen by heavy snow and over the mountains where an earthquake occurred?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/SmallTitle_Eng_Friendship.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/\uc6b0\uc8151.gif?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your adventure is accompanied by unusual 'KIND' friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They include athletes running on the water and young monk who break rocks in rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/\uc6b0\uc8152.gif?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You receive help from their special abilities. And use the power of cooperation. Let's push heavy objects together and do our part even if they are separated from each other. Then you can overcome any ordeal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/\uc6b0\uc8153.gif?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/SmallTitle_Eng_Retro_Sense.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your adventure is full of visuals from 2000s portable game consoles, music from those days, and such environments and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's go together to the world of 'KIND' where the way of expression, the way of play, and the way of the story all remind us of longing!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723140?t=1747894143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723140?t=1747894143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/873d66b6de95dcda1d1c826c84faa138139feb6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747894143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/873d66b6de95dcda1d1c826c84faa138139feb6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747894143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/MiddleTitle_Eng_Story.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure with 'KIND'</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'KIND' are beings who can speak human words and have similar intelligence to humans. They were described as gods in the far distant past and then as monsters and ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some 'KIND' have much stronger power than humans, while others 'KIND' run on water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These mysterious beings are not easily seen in cities, but they seem to be quite common in the countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/1.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You come to visit your rural grandmother's house for the anniversary of the opening of elementary school, and you get lost in the forest where there is a magic well, and you meet with 'KIND' Barabin, an explorer who resembles kidney beans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/VERTICAL_GAME_INTRO_IMAGE_ENG_\ud0c0\uc774\ud2c0\uc218\uc815.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The explorer Barabin, who never leaves a troubled man alone,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With him, the journey begins to return to his grandmother's house!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/MiddleTitle_Eng_Feature.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/SmallTitle_Eng_Adventure.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/\uc608\uce21\ubd88\ud5c8_1.gif?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your adventure is full of unknowable weather events and strange events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What other events will unfold in front of you after crossing a lake frozen by heavy snow and over the mountains where an earthquake occurred?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/SmallTitle_Eng_Friendship.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/\uc6b0\uc8151.gif?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your adventure is accompanied by unusual 'KIND' friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They include athletes running on the water and young monk who break rocks in rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/\uc6b0\uc8152.gif?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You receive help from their special abilities. And use the power of cooperation. Let's push heavy objects together and do our part even if they are separated from each other. Then you can overcome any ordeal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/\uc6b0\uc8153.gif?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/extras/SmallTitle_Eng_Retro_Sense.png?t=1747894143\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your adventure is full of visuals from 2000s portable game consoles, music from those days, and such environments and stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's go together to the world of 'KIND' where the way of expression, the way of play, and the way of the story all remind us of longing!</p>","developers":["Antialiasing Corp."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723140/2964a8015ed09c84f105d3803e3939f5754428d5/header.jpg?t=1747894143","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136411,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136411/movie480.mp4?t=1747340159","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136411/movie_max.mp4?t=